#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:43
#: 85ae26c22a034994bb1ed2f54b8af626
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:44
#: 0726a438a850445d9ab69b120656f57e
msgid "The default RC input is configured on the UART3 (RX3/SBUS). Non SBUS,  single wire serial inputs can be directly tied to RX3 if SBUS pin is left unconnected. RC could  be applied instead at a different UART port such as UART4 or UART8, and set the protocol to receive RC data: ``SERIALn_PROTOCOL = 23`` and change :ref:`SERIAL3_PROTOCOL<SERIAL3_PROTOCOL>` to something other than '23'."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:46
#: e17437f06e13459abc4d9ad2912ea327
msgid "PPM is not supported."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:47
#: df1188c3d5674049856b781d04ba70b0
msgid "SBUS/DSM/SRXL connects to the RX3 pin."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:48
#: 26d93d5d6fc74ed0840903d3e413f7cc
msgid "FPort requires connection to TX3. Set :ref:`SERIAL3_OPTIONS<SERIAL3_OPTIONS>` = 7"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:49
#: aa2f7db39d42426a88a9d62147807fe2
msgid "CRSF/ELRS also requires both TX3 and RX3 connections and provides telemetry automatically."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:52
#: 1a5fa60addae47988115427a26f6c8e1
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:53
#: 8f2f945cdae94cadb5939122c921743d
msgid "DisplayPort OSD is available by default on the HD VTX connector."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:56
#: fba8df226af24bd2a90c65c721b21f30
msgid "VTX Support"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:57
#: e324236bbb9d4cc1869841c2e3ce65d6
msgid "The SH1.0-6P connector supports a DJI Air Unit / HD VTX connection. Protocol defaults to DisplayPort. Pin 1 of the connector is 10v so be careful not to connect this to a peripheral requiring 5v. DisplayPort OSD is enabled by default on SERIAL8."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:60
#: abb6fa0f5c844d41bf4f48fa40da1ebc
msgid "VTX power control"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:61
#: 8dbf22836f9d427ba1b67ff1a25f3e22
msgid "GPIO 83 controls the VTX BEC output to pins marked \"12V\" and is included on the HD VTX connector. Setting this GPIO low removes voltage supply to this pin/pad. By default RELAY3 is configured to control this pin and sets the GPIO high at boot."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:64
#: 262075b4d4f240a4a62243b91715f9a0
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:65
#: 1bf210f34010477381c785095cc20705
msgid "The autopilot supports up to 9 PWM (8 + LED) outputs. The pads for motor output M1 to M8 are provided on both the motor connectors and on separate pads, plus M9 on a separate pad for LED strip (default configuration) or another PWM output."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:69
#: c7f209e53dc740f5a98fcc33d49ef3ab
msgid "The PWM is in 4 groups:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:71
#: 825801981ab04e3181e140789b16ec13
msgid "PWM 1-4 in group1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:72
#: 199d2352f15143b8bba003b0e8c6b553
msgid "PWM 5-8 in group2"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:73
#: 7475edbea6bb488699a857b75c277b7f
msgid "PWM 9 (LED) in group3"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:75
#: 3993cc72e07a4b40a5ef929d5f38afc7
msgid "Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use DShot. Channels 1-8 support bi-directional dshot."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:80
#: d41a036da7e14ba7969d2e945da14879
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:81
#: c5cd572b41af4fb0a0d2e4af312430a9
msgid "The board has a internal voltage sensor and connections on the ESC connector for an external current sensor input. The voltage sensor can handle up to 6S LiPo batteries."
msgstr ""

